  "description": "Your adventure starts at your doorstep. Our new ADVENTR 11 ABS combines the best of both worlds – combining top-notch safety with maximum riding fun. Built on the ALLTRAIL frame platform and equipped with 140mm front and 130mm rear travel, it shares the same capabilities as our sporty full-suspension eMountain bikes. On the other hand, the robust rear rack, reliable tyres and innovative eBike ABS ensure it handles everyday tasks just as easily. No matter what terrain you choose, the powerful Bosch Performance Line CX motor will push you forward with ease. And with the long-range 800Wh battery, your rides can go on even longer. In short, with this SUV eBike, your adventures start right at your doorstep!",
